SUMMARY:shut in 10.5 mile cardio hike
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nmeet/ park at the river park\nWE H
 IKE AT A FAST PACE WITHOUT BREAKS. This is primarily a fitness oriented ev
 ent. While we try to stay together as a group\, we will not wait for exten
 ded periods at intersections. Sometimes a bit of trail running can even be
  involved. If you haven't hiked with this fitness group before and are uns
 ure of your abilities\, be prepared and know your way back to your car. If
  carpooling is involved please do so appropriately\, or drive yourself to 
 the trailhead.\n\nHIKE DESCRIPTION:\n\nany rain cancellation will be poste
 d by 7am morning of hike Dogs Welcome. The hike is an out & back 10.5 mile
  LEVEL 7\\* fitness hike that begins at the Bent Creek river park where we
  take a short connector trail to the MST (Mountain to Sea Trail) South\, t
 o the Sleepy Gap overlook\, and back. The out hike has 3 steep climbs and 
 for those who desire an additional climbing challenge\, a spur trail of 40
 0+ feet elevation is available that rejoins the regular MST trail at Sleep
 y Gap. The return has one steep climb with mild elevation changes between 
 the 3 steeper downhill sections. The trail parallels the Blue Ridge Parkwa
 y and includes an overlook of the French Broad River valley and opposing m
 ountains\, distant views of Asheville. Bring water and snacks - we will st
 op at the turnaround point for a short break so Osa can have a snack (or t
 hree).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315619580
 /
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260709T210349Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260709T210349Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
